screenless — third-party software

This repository contains only original scripts and documentation (MIT, see LICENSE).
It does not bundle third-party binaries. At install time it downloads or uses:

- scrcpy, by Genymobile — Apache License 2.0 — https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy
  (screen mirroring and control; includes adb on Windows)
- Android Debug Bridge (adb), Android SDK Platform-Tools, by Google — Apache License 2.0
- Anthropic Python SDK (agent/ only) — MIT — https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python
- Pillow (agent/ only) — MIT-CMU — https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow
